 the configured"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Origin","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", selecting between PIN and built-in user verification, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"processing extensions before the request reaches the authenticator."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use "},{"code":"Client","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for any app that runs passkey ceremonies. Reach for "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/Session","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"directly only when you need lower-level access — raw "},{"code":"makeCredential","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" \/"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"getAssertion","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", credential management, or bio enrollment."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Client"},{"text":" is an actor; a client’s lifetime is bound to the underlying ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/Session","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The constructor takes four parameters that shape every ceremony:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"origin","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — the secure origin the client is bound to. ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Origin","isActive":true},{"text":" enforces","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the W3C secure-context rule; the client refuses to sign for relying parties whose","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"identifier doesn’t match.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isPublicSuffix"},{"type":"text","text":" — a closure into a Public Suffix List, used to validate that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the relying-party identifier is a registrable suffix of the origin’s effective"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"domain."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"enterpriseRpIds"},{"type":"text","text":" — relying-party identifiers allowed to receive"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"platform-managed enterprise attestation. When the request specifies"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/AttestationPreference\/enterprise","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", the client escalates to level 2"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(platform-managed) for RPs in this set, and uses level 1 (vendor-facilitated)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"otherwise."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"allowedExtensions","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — the set of WebAuthn extensions the client will process.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Anything the relying party requests outside this set is dropped before reaching","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the authenticator. Defaults to ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Extension","type":"reference"},{"text":"’s standard set.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"PIN and user verification are supplied per ceremony via "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Authorization","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","te